#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""work: a small editor suite built from sway, foot and your editor of choice.

usage:
  work                 open the current folder
  work DIR             open DIR on a new sway workspace: file tree on the
                       left, editors in a tabbed pane on the right
  work FILE            open FILE in the running work session that contains
                       it (or start a session in the file's folder)
  work --default-config
                       print the default config (save it to
                       ~/.config/work/config to change it)

Keys in the file tree: press ? inside it.
"""

